{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 4期生 岩手県出身"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤璃果です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ6H68FYZNHSVVE1EBQC2R1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、5月7日は、\nテレビ朝日さんの「ミュージックステーション｣に乃木坂46の4期生メンバーで\n「I see...」を披露させていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのミュージックステーションさん。\n本当に貴重でありがたい経験をさせて\n頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演することを喜んでくれる皆さんの\n大切さもさらに感じました。\nこれからも色んな喜びを沢山\n共にしていけたらいいなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、素敵な新衣装を\n作っていただきました！✧︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ6H7BVNDPBK2Q4BV1NR9PE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花の刺繍がとっても可愛いんです！\nそして大きなリボンと、\n紫色も素敵です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イヤリングも可愛くて、\nカチューシャもあったりして、本当に素敵な衣装をありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZ6H8DEDYSFN32SK9TYP5SR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リボンちゃんもつけてました✧︎\nこの髪型すごく好きです！\nメイクさんに感謝！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして本日は\n9th YEAR BIRTHDAY LIVE ～4期生ライブ～です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しています。\n緊張は愛や尊敬や感謝から\n来るものでもあります。\nいい物をお届けしたいという気持ちでもあります。\n16人で素敵な時間を皆さんに届けられるように精一杯努めます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん見てください( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.nogizaka46.com/smph/9thyear_birthday_live_3ki4ki/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に沢山盛り上がりましょうね〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の3期生さんのライブもとっても楽しみですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#78 りか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}],"source":"archive"}